  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.ixion.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.ixion.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_ixion"><head>ΙΞΙΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-ixion-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_ixion">
            <note type="source">1. Plut. de aud. poet. 3, (p. 18 E.) Stobæus II, 8.</note>
          </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-ixion-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_ixion" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.ixion.nauck1889grc1:426">
            <note type="source">2. Stobæus LI, 11.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τά τοι μέγιστα πάντ᾽ ἐργάζεται βροτοῖς</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τόλμ᾽ ὥστε νικᾶν· οὔτε γὰρ τυραννίδες</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">χωρὶς πόνου γένοιντ᾽ ἂν, οὔτ᾽ οἶκος μέγας.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-ixion-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_ixion" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.ixion.nauck1889grc1:425">
            <note type="source">3. Stobæus X, 7.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὅστις γὰρ ἐπὶ τὸ πλέον ἔχειν πέφυκ᾽ ἀνὴρ,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">οὐδὲν φρονεῖ δίκαιον, οὐδὲ βούλεται,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">φίλοις τ᾽ ἄμικτός ἐστι καὶ πάσῃ πόλει.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-ixion-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_ixion" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.ixion.nauck1889grc1:424">
            <note type="source">4. Schol. Apoll. Rhod. III, 62. Φλεγύου δὲ παῖς καὶ Ἰξίων, ὡς καὶ Εὐριπίδης·</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Φλεγύαντος υἱὲ, δέσποτ᾽ Ἰξίων *</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-ixion-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_ixion">
            <note type="source">5. Diog. Laert. IX, 55. φησὶ δὲ Φιλόχορος, πλέοντος αὐτοῦ (Πρωταγόρου) ἐς Σικελίαν τὴν ναῦν καταποντισθῆναι, καὶ τοῦτο αἰνίττεσθαι Εὐριπίδην ἐν Ἰξίονι.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
